prayerTemplate:
PRAYER

In the light of the facts and circumstances stated above, the Applicant most respectfully prays that this Hon'ble Court may graciously be pleased to:

a) Grant a temporary injunction under Order 39 Rules 1 and 2 read with Section 151 CPC restraining the Defendant/Non-Applicant, his agents, servants, representatives, assigns, and all persons claiming through or under him, from {acts_complained_of} pending final disposal of the suit;

b) In the alternative and pending notice to the Non-Applicant, grant an ad-interim ex parte order in terms of prayer (a) above for the reasons stated hereinabove, in exercise of powers under the proviso to Order 39 Rule 3 CPC;

c) Award costs of this application;

d) Pass any other order(s) as this Hon'ble Court may deem fit and proper in the interest of justice.

And for this act of kindness, the Applicant shall ever pray.
